{"3678730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ball Maze", "steam_appid": 3678730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/bb32eefecec9d758072b87c90565ff02.avif?t=1784301025\" width=615 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/78eb82b7da0371d5b4f0b01c9bdf8982.poster.avif?t=1784301025\" width=614 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/78eb82b7da0371d5b4f0b01c9bdf8982.webm?t=1784301025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/78eb82b7da0371d5b4f0b01c9bdf8982.mp4?t=1784301025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>By rotating the entire 3D maze, skillfully using gravity and inertia, guiding the ball through the complex structure, and finally reaching the end, you can experience the unique control fun brought by the laws of physics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/f9d132f372f2dd94eaa43619cbcf0199.avif?t=1784301025\" width=615 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/1bd2394dc0929a2aa0773e65c5dab35a.poster.avif?t=1784301025\" width=614 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/1bd2394dc0929a2aa0773e65c5dab35a.webm?t=1784301025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/1bd2394dc0929a2aa0773e65c5dab35a.mp4?t=1784301025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dare to venture into multiple themed maze worlds with different designs. Each world hides unique mechanisms and new physical mechanisms waiting for you to master. Complete the exclusive challenge tasks of each maze to unlock many personalized balls with &quot;special abilities&quot;!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/0a57a2ae4794069a88f34b48f2753c1f.avif?t=1784301025\" width=615 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/cd5ad26b060ab55b9cea8c03a170184d.poster.avif?t=1784301025\" width=614 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/cd5ad26b060ab55b9cea8c03a170184d.webm?t=1784301025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/cd5ad26b060ab55b9cea8c03a170184d.mp4?t=1784301025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use the new abilities of your character balls to conquer levels with completely different strategies and techniques, and compete with other players on the leaderboards.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/bb32eefecec9d758072b87c90565ff02.avif?t=1784301025\" width=615 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678730/extras/78eb82b7da0371d5b4f0b01c9bdf8982.poster.avif?t=1784301025\" width=614 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps